@baseUrl = http://localhost:5155/api
@adminUserId = 1
@regularUserId = 2

### ===== EVENTS =====

### 1. Get All Events
GET {{baseUrl}}/events

### 2. Get Active Events
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/active

### 3. Get Event by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/1

### 4. Get Event by ID - 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/2

### 5. Create Event (Admin Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/events?adminUserId={{adminUserId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Training: ASP.NET 9 New Features",
  "description": "Descoperă noile feature-uri din ASP.NET 9",
  "startDate": "2026-12-01T18:00:00Z",
  "registrationDeadline": "2026-11-25T23:59:59Z",
  "maxParticipants": 25,
  "location": "Sibiu - Tech Academy"
}

### 6. Create Event - Validation Test (deadline after start)
POST {{baseUrl}}/events?adminUserId={{adminUserId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Invalid Event",
  "description": "Test invalid event",
  "startDate": "2026-10-01T10:00:00Z",
  "registrationDeadline": "2026-10-15T23:59:59Z",
  "maxParticipants": 10,
  "location": "Sibiu"
}

### 7. Update Event
PUT {{baseUrl}}/events/1?adminUserId={{adminUserId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Workshop: ASP.NET Core - UPDATED",
  "maxParticipants": 35,
  "location": "Sibiu - Innovation Hub"
}

### 8. Delete Event (Admin Only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/events/1?adminUserId={{adminUserId}}

### 9. Get Event Participants (Admin Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/1/participants?adminUserId={{adminUserId}}

### ===== USERS =====

### 10. Get All Users
GET {{baseUrl}}/users

### 11. Get User by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1

### 12. Get User by ID - Regular User
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/2

### 13. Create User
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@sibiuevents.com",
  "fullName": "Ana Dumitru"
}

### 14. Create Another User
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "george@sibiuevents.com",
  "fullName": "George Ionescu"
}

### 15. Create User - Email already exists
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@sibiuevents.com",
  "fullName": "Another User"
}

### ===== REGISTRATIONS =====

### 16. Join Event (User 2 -> Event 3)
POST {{baseUrl}}/registrations/join?userId={{regularUserId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": 3
}

### 17. Join Event - Different User and Event
POST {{baseUrl}}/registrations/join?userId={{regularUserId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": 4
}

### 18. Try to Join Same Event Again (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/registrations/join?userId={{regularUserId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": 3
}

### 19. Join Event - Event Not Found
POST {{baseUrl}}/registrations/join?userId={{regularUserId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": 999
}

### 20. Get User Registrations
GET {{baseUrl}}/registrations/user/{{regularUserId}}

### 21. Get User Registrations - Another User
GET {{baseUrl}}/registrations/user/1

### 22. Cancel Registration
POST {{baseUrl}}/registrations/cancel?userId={{regularUserId}}&eventId=4

### ===== ADMIN OPERATIONS =====

### 23. Create Event as Regular User (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/events?adminUserId={{regularUserId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Unauthorized Event",
  "description": "This should fail",
  "startDate": "2026-11-01T10:00:00Z",
  "registrationDeadline": "2026-10-25T23:59:59Z",
  "maxParticipants": 20,
  "location": "Sibiu"
}

### 24. Delete Event as Regular User (Should Fail)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/events/2?adminUserId={{regularUserId}}

### 25. Get Participants as Regular User (Should Fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/1/participants?adminUserId={{regularUserId}}

### ===== SPECIAL SCENARIOS =====

### 26. Create Event with Max Participants = 0 (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/events?adminUserId={{adminUserId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Invalid Event",
  "description": "No spots",
  "startDate": "2026-10-01T10:00:00Z",
  "registrationDeadline": "2026-09-25T23:59:59Z",
  "maxParticipants": 0,
  "location": "Sibiu"
}

### 27. Get Events - Count them
GET {{baseUrl}}/events

### 28. Get Active Events - Only open registration
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/active
